        "text": "=👋 Welcome {{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.first_name }}!  \nI'm your personal AI assistant for business and personal task management.  \nHere's what I can do:  \n📋 /tasks — View all your pending tasks \n📅 /today — What you need to do today \n➕ /add — Add a task manually \n✅ /done — Mark a task complete \n🗓 /week — Your week summary  \nJust type or send a voice note with your tasks and I'll handle everything automatically!",
